# AI adapters

- Adapters own provider SDK calls, prompts, and model selection only.
- Export a `*_PROMPT_VERSION` constant; bump it when the prompt or model changes.
- All model output must pass through a Zod schema (`*.schema.ts`) before leaving the adapter.
- No database access, auth checks, or HTTP handling in adapters.
- Follow `docs/08-AI-SPEC.md`; never fabricate candidate facts or bypass human approval flows.
